Evaluate integration and acceptance coverage. Do not edit files. Treat this recompose subworkflow as part of the named live parent phase-decompose arc. Check the field-shape bridge from sub_results exports into this council input and the full e2e conjunction in recompose_contract.cross_subunit_tests; do not downgrade the run to static-only when the parent arc is live. The Decompose subworkflow can only export DAG JSON after lint-dag.py has compared each final sub_unit.bytes value with bbox_ref_size measured bytes for that same sub_unit.refs cluster and checked the target_context_window. Do not compare proposal-round or ResolveDebate measurements for a different candidate ref cluster against the final DAG refs. Treat older phase-decompose thread ids inside evidence_bundle text as stale unless they match sub_results arc ids or the live parent arc id. Return concise findings for the facilitator.

